.TH KUBECTL-GROOT 1 "2026-08-04" "groot v1.0.6" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
kubectl-groot \- kubectl plugin entry point for groot
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kubectl groot
[\fIcommand\fR] [\fIflags\fR]
.PP
.B kubectl-groot
[\fIcommand\fR] [\fIflags\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B kubectl-groot
is the same program as
.BR groot (1),
installed with basename
.B kubectl-groot
so that
.B kubectl
discovers it as the
.B groot
plugin (
.BR "kubectl groot ..." ).
.PP
All commands, flags, configuration, and exit codes match
.BR groot (1).
Prefer
.B kubectl groot \-\-help
or
.B man groot
for the full reference.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR groot (1).
.SH AUTHORS
Maintained by hrodrig and contributors.
